WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,530
The carrot cake is still warm. Eat it quickly.

2
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,090
Dad, this stuff is so delicious

3
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:28,990
why don't you eat

4
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,190
Save it for the big duck

5
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,350
If the big duck wants to eat, I can buy it for him

6
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,190
But this time I have to share it with you. You have to eat it.

7
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,910
As an adult, I can compete with children for food. It’s not a competition.

8
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,980
Our family has no shortage of this kind of food.

9
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:42,760
There is no need to leave everything for the children to eat quickly

10
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:43,960
If you don’t eat anymore

11
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,240
I'll just feed you mouth to mouth

12
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,380
Don't talk nonsense

13
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,940
If there are people coming and going in this place, then you can eat it.

14
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,320
You know my temper

15
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,640
I just say what I say
